    "text": "Caught in the {RAIN} on Milsom Street, Anne waits in a shop while Mr. Elliot fetches an {UMBRELLA}. In walks Wentworth, {CONFUSED} and red. Elizabeth {CUTS} him dead, but he offers Anne his own. Mr. Elliot comes back and leads her off on his {ARM}, and the {LADIES} whisper that surely the {COUSINS} will marry.",
